#: tarot_strings.lua:262
msgid ""
"Tarot is a deck of 78 cards, divided into Major Arcana (22) and Minor Arcana ("
"56), used for reflection and self-knowledge. The Lenormand deck has 36 cards w"
"ith direct symbolism for practical guidance.\n"
"\n"
"Credits for the free card images:\n"
"• Lenormand Cards by Yve Lepkowski (https://stolen-thyme.com/)\n"
"• Tarot Cards by Luciella Elisabeth Scarlett (https://luciellaes.itch.io/)"
msgstr ""
"Tarot is a deck of 78 cards, divided into Major Arcana (22) and Minor Arcana ("
"56), used for reflection and self-knowledge. The Lenormand deck has 36 cards w"
"ith direct symbolism for practical guidance.\n"
"\n"
"Credits for the free card images:\n"
"• Lenormand Cards by Yve Lepkowski (https://stolen-thyme.com/)\n"
"• Tarot Cards by Luciella Elisabeth Scarlett (https://luciellaes.itch.io/)"

